%% STATUS: TARGET (proposed, not implemented)
sequenceDiagram
  actor X as Unauthorized client
  participant MW as Route guard
  participant RL as Rate limiter
  participant AU as Audit log
  participant API as Protected handler
  participant DB as Postgres
  X->>MW: GET /api/calls/id/transcript
  MW->>RL: Check limit
  alt Limit exceeded
    RL-->>X: 429
  else Within limit
    MW->>MW: Validate session
    alt No valid session
      MW->>AU: Record denied access
      MW-->>X: 401 with generic error
    else Valid session, missing permission
      MW->>AU: Record denied access with user ID
      MW-->>X: 403 with generic error
    else Valid session and permission
      MW->>API: Forward with user and organization
      API->>DB: Query scoped to organization
      alt Record in another organization
        DB-->>API: No row
        API-->>X: 404, existence not revealed
      else Found
        DB-->>API: Record
        API->>AU: Record transcript access
        API-->>X: 200
      end
    end
  end
